## 127. Analogy Master Table

| Relationship | Example |
|---|---|
| Synonym | Big : Large |
| Antonym | Hot : Cold |
| Function | Pen : Write |
| Workplace | Doctor : Hospital |
| Tool | Carpenter : Saw |
| Home | Bird : Nest |
| Young one | Cow : Calf |
| Gender | King : Queen |
| Part-whole | Wheel : Car |
| Material-product | Wood : Furniture |
| Cause-effect | Fire : Smoke |
| Organ-function | Eye : See |
| Instrument-measurement | Thermometer : Temperature |
| Country-capital | India : New Delhi |
| Country-currency | India : Rupee |
| Category | Rose : Flower |
| Number-square | 5 : 25 |
| Number-cube | 3 : 27 |
| Number-product | 23 : 6 |
| Letter-shift | A : D |

