## 128. Universal Analogy Template

```text
             A : B :: C : ?
                 │
                 ▼
          Find relation R
                 │
                 ▼
              A ─R→ B
                 │
                 ▼
              C ─R→ ?
                 │
                 ▼
             Verify
                 │
                 ▼
              ANSWER
```

---

## 129. Advanced Verification

Before finalizing:

#### Check 1 — Direction

Is the relationship in the same direction?

#### Check 2 — Category

Are both pairs in comparable domains?

#### Check 3 — Strength

Is the relation equally strong?

#### Check 4 — Specificity

Are the answers at the same conceptual level?

#### Check 5 — Simplicity

Is there a simpler rule?

---
